  "skill_short_description": "Agent-driven multi-marker Nanopore eDNA metabarcoding (16S, 18S, 12S-MiFish, COI, ITS): three cross-classification methods by default, reference retrieval delegated to biodb-fetch.",
  "skill_description": "End-to-end agent orchestration of Nanopore-sequenced eDNA metabarcoding, multi-marker since v0.5.0: 16S (Bacteria/Archaea), 18S (full-length or V9/Euka02-class), 12S (MiFish-class), COI, ITS \u2014 bundled per-marker presets with validated length windows, kingdoms and biodb-fetch retrieval keys. Three classification methods run by default (readbased+minimap2/LCA, readbased+IdTaxa/SILVA, consensus+medaka-polish+classification; 12S/COI/ITS default to minimap2-LCA with custom-trained IdTaxa opt-in). Reference-database retrieval is delegated to the biodb-fetch dependency skill under the manifest.tsv contract.",
